<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mostly lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 13.79 to 5993.23.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.41 to 373.72.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.04.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1180 to 1171.</p>
<p>Volume was 437,773,440, compared with 441,080,570 Tuesday.</p>
